      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T04:18:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If CONFIG_USB_PD_DEBUG_LEVEL is undefined, the strings should be included because debug_level can be changed at run-time.\n\nHave you tried \u0027pd dump 1\u0027 to raise debug level?",
      "parentUuid": "17dd91e2_00d18efe",
