        "id": 1287197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T19:09:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we anticipate platforms which run host commands removing the strings from their builds?  The most constrained platforms I know of (servo_v4, zinger, etc.) aren\u0027t also running host commands.  \n\nI can understand taking the time to up-rev the command structure and maintain the strings in ectool if it\u0027s anticipated that a lot of platforms will want to remove the strings, it just seems like it might be over-developing for a currently unused scenario.",
      "parentUuid": "78610454_8e5d837c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 5009,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 5014,
        "endChar": 6
